---
title: "Krewire — One Go Framework for Every Workload"
description: "Unified Go Framework for every workload — app, cli, site, book, worker, service, infra, runtime. One CLI kiw, one config krewire.yaml."
layout: Landing
---

<!-- =====================================================================
     HERO
     ===================================================================== -->
<section class="w-full bg-bg dark:bg-bg-dark bg-dots py-10 md:py-14 lg:py-20" style="border-bottom:var(--pop-border)">
  <div class="container-site">
    <div class="flex flex-col md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:items-center gap-8 lg:gap-12">

      <!-- Copy -->
      <div class="min-w-0">
        <!-- Eyebrow -->
        <div class="badge badge-primary mb-4">
          <span>◈</span>
          <span>Unified Go Framework · v0.1.0 · Open Source</span>
        </div>

        <!-- Headline -->
        <h1 class="font-black tracking-tighter leading-tight mb-4 text-fg dark:text-fg-dark"
            style="font-size:clamp(32px,7vw,56px); letter-spacing:-0.04em">
          One Go Framework.<br>Every Workload.
        </h1>

        <!-- Lead -->
        <p class="text-base text-muted dark:text-muted-dark leading-relaxed mb-5 max-w-lg">
          From single-binary web monoliths to interactive TUIs, high-speed static sites, book pipelines, background workers, microservices, cloud infra, and Go WebAssembly runtimes — build everything in Go with one CLI <code class="code-inline">kiw</code> and zero JS fatigue.
        </p>

        <!-- Quick terminal: install first -->
        <div class="mb-5 max-w-lg flex flex-col gap-2">
          <!-- Install -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-[10px] px-3 py-2.5 overflow-x-auto bg-bg-2 dark:bg-bg-dark-2"
               style="border:var(--pop-border); box-shadow:var(--pop-shadow-sm)">
            <span class="font-mono font-black text-primary text-sm shrink-0">$</span>
            <code class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-fg dark:text-fg-dark whitespace-nowrap flex-1">curl -fsSL https://krewire.com/scripts/install.sh | sh</code>
            <button class="btn-copy shrink-0 text-xs font-black px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-secondary text-secondary-content transition-all duration-150"
                    style="border:var(--pop-border-thin); box-shadow:1.5px 1.5px 0px var(--border)"
                    onclick="copyCmd(this,'curl -fsSL https://krewire.com/scripts/install.sh | sh')">Copy</button>
          </div>
          <!-- Then scaffold -->
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 rounded-[10px] px-3 py-2.5 overflow-x-auto bg-bg-2 dark:bg-bg-dark-2"
               style="border:var(--pop-border); box-shadow:var(--pop-shadow-sm)">
            <span class="font-mono font-black text-muted dark:text-muted-dark text-sm shrink-0">$</span>
            <code class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-fg dark:text-fg-dark whitespace-nowrap flex-1">kiw new my-app --site &amp;&amp; cd my-app &amp;&amp; kiw dev</code>
            <button class="btn-copy shrink-0 text-xs font-black px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md bg-secondary text-secondary-content transition-all duration-150"
                    style="border:var(--pop-border-thin); box-shadow:1.5px 1.5px 0px var(--border)"
                    onclick="copyCmd(this,'kiw new my-app --site &amp;&amp; cd my-app &amp;&amp; kiw dev')">Copy</button>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- CTAs: stacked on mobile, row on sm+ -->
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-3 mb-4">
          <a href="/getting-started" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Get Started — 5 Min →</a>
          <a href="#workloads"            class="btn btn-lg">Explore 8 Workloads ↓</a>
        </div>

        <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">Go 1.22+ · File-based routing · Scoped CSS · 100% Zero JS by default</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Art / Code window -->
      <div class="min-w-0 w-full">
        {{component "CodeWindow" .}}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

