<span style="color:#39D353;font-weight:700">&lt;/style&gt;</span></code></pre>
        <!-- Panel footer -->
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2.5 px-4 py-4" style="background:#071426; border-top:1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1)">
          <a href="/docs/krewire-framework#4-the-kiw-component-dsl" class="btn btn-primary text-xs px-4 py-2 min-h-0">Explore DSL Syntax →</a>
          <a href="/getting-started"  class="btn text-xs px-4 py-2 min-h-0 text-fg dark:text-fg-dark" style="background:#0B1F3B; color:#FAF8F4">Read the Docs</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Feature panel -->
      <div class="card">
        <div class="mb-4">
          <span class="badge badge-secondary mb-2">Scoping</span>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-black tracking-tight mt-2 text-fg dark:text-fg-dark">Why Scoped CSS in Go?</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="text-sm text-muted dark:text-muted-dark leading-relaxed mb-5">
          Every <code class="code-inline">.kiw</code> component receives automatic <code class="code-inline">data-kiw-component</code> scope hashing at build time. No CSS collisions, no naming gymnastics, zero runtime cost.
        </p>
        <ul class="flex flex-col gap-3 p-0 m-0 list-none">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-muted dark:text-muted-dark leading-snug">
            <span class="text-primary font-black text-base shrink-0 leading-tight">✓</span>
            <span><b class="text-fg dark:text-fg-dark">Scoped by Default:</b> Styles remain strictly isolated to the component.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-muted dark:text-muted-dark leading-snug">
            <span class="text-primary font-black text-base shrink-0 leading-tight">✓</span>
            <span><b class="text-fg dark:text-fg-dark">Global CSS via <code class="code-inline">:root</code>:</b> Theme tokens cascade cleanly across layouts.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-muted dark:text-muted-dark leading-snug">
            <span class="text-primary font-black text-base shrink-0 leading-tight">✓</span>
            <span><b class="text-fg dark:text-fg-dark">No Bundler Required:</b> Built directly by the Go compiler without npm.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-start gap-2.5 text-sm text-muted dark:text-muted-dark leading-snug">
            <span class="text-primary font-black text-base shrink-0 leading-tight">✓</span>
            <span><b class="text-fg dark:text-fg-dark">Light &amp; Dark Mode:</b> Native token switching via <code class="code-inline">data-theme</code>.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- =====================================================================
     COMPARISON MATRIX
     ===================================================================== -->
<section class="w-full bg-bg dark:bg-bg-dark py-12 lg:py-16" style="border-bottom:var(--pop-border)">
  <div class="container-site">
    <div class="section-head">
      <span class="badge badge-primary mb-3">Stack Comparison</span>
      <h2>Why Engineers Choose Krewire</h2>
      <p>Compare the simplicity of an all-in-one Go toolchain against fragmented multi-language setups.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="overflow-x-auto rounded-xl" style="border:var(--pop-border); box-shadow:var(--pop-shadow-lg); background:var(--bg)">
      <table class="w-full text-left border-collapse text-sm">
        <thead>
          <tr style="border-bottom:var(--pop-border); background:var(--bg-2)">
            <th class="py-3.5 px-4 font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-fg dark:text-fg-dark">Architecture Dimension</th>
            <th class="py-3.5 px-4 font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">Traditional Fragmented Stack</th>
            <th class="py-3.5 px-4 font-black text-xs uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">Krewire Unified Go</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y" style="border-color:var(--border-subtle)">
          <tr>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-fg dark:text-fg-dark">Toolchain &amp; Runtime</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">2–3 Languages (Go + Node.js/TS + Python/HCL)</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-primary">100% Pure Go across all workloads</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-fg dark:text-fg-dark">Package Management</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-muted dark:text-muted-dark"><code class="code-inline">go.mod</code> + <code class="code-inline">package.json</code> + npm/pnpm trees</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-primary">Single <code class="code-inline">go.mod</code> (Zero npm / Zero JS)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-fg dark:text-fg-dark">Developer CLI</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">Multiple: Air + npm + Cobra + Terraform</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-primary">One binary CLI: <code class="code-inline">kiw</code></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-fg dark:text-fg-dark">Configuration</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">Scattered (.air.toml, vite.config, tsconfig, Dockerfile)</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-primary">Single unified <code class="code-inline">krewire.yaml</code></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-fg dark:text-fg-dark">Component Styling</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">Tailwind CLI / PostCSS bundler pipeline</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-primary">Native scoped <code class="code-inline">.kiw</code> components</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-fg dark:text-fg-dark">Production Deployment</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 text-muted dark:text-muted-dark">Heavy multi-stage Docker containers with Node layers</td>
            <td class="py-3.5 px-4 font-bold text-primary">Single self-contained Go binary or static assets</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

